Playing a wonderful Valkryie character, I discovered a chaotic
altar about level 7 or so.  (Yeah!  A chance at a named weapon!)
Only problem: no animals on the level to speak of.
 
So, I robbed a shop on the same level, and got bunches of Kops
to follow me back to the altar.  Everytime I sacrificed a dead Kop,
though, I got a demon lord appearing.  Luckily, since I was chaotic,
they didn't do anything to me, but I obviously wasn't getting any
closer to a named weapon.
 
What was I doing wrong?  I take it that Kops aren't acceptable
sacrifices?
 
